{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港交所方面透露，今年以來TMT同人工智能相關公司佔港股IPO集資總額約70%，市場關注AI過度投資，如何平衡鼓勵創新及防範風險。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n財政司司長陳茂波總結APEC財長會回應有關提問，指出香港上市制度要緊貼實體經濟發展，與時並進，方便不同類型科技企業上市，同時強調證監會及港交所不會放鬆監管。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T11:40:34.979312+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:03:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T14:17:56.091415+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:37:43.998766+00:00","content_hash":"b13701183eaf1e90f5727118d5b76d3c20b9cdf3c300df09f5c80739184f1d60","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}